@ref Acts Interpretation Act 1901 s 33A(4) "office" (src:689)
`section 33A(4) defines office` MEANS
    `A meaning stated by the Act` OF `states what is included`, NOTHING, (LIST "a position occupied by an APS employee"), EMPTY, NOTHING, NOTHING

-- src:751 | (2) In this section, paper includes:
-- src:752 | (a) an ordinance, rule, regulation or by-law;
-- src:753 | (b) a report; and
-- src:754 | (c) any other document or instrument whatsoever.
-- gloss: paper covers an ordinance, rule, regulation or by-law; a report; any other document or instrument whatsoever (and is not limited to them)
-- members, pass 2: limbs (a) and (c) are also listed one noun at a time, bare and with their article; limb (b) is one noun
@ref Acts Interpretation Act 1901 s 34B(2) "paper" (src:751-754)
`section 34B(2) defines paper` MEANS
    `A meaning stated by the Act` OF `states what is included`, NOTHING, (LIST "an ordinance, rule, regulation or by-law", "ordinance", "an ordinance", "rule", "a rule", "regulation", "a regulation", "by-law", "a by-law", "a report", "any other document or instrument whatsoever", "any other document", "any other instrument", "document", "a document", "instrument", "an instrument"), EMPTY, NOTHING, NOTHING

-- src:757 | periodic report means a regular report relating to:
-- src:758 | (a) the activities, operations, business or affairs of a person; or
-- src:759 | (b) the administration, operation or working of an Act or part of an Act;
-- src:760 | during a particular period that ends on or after 30 June 1983.
-- gloss: periodic report stands for: a regular report relating to
-- members, pass 2: limbs (a) and (b) are also listed one noun at a time, bare and with the Act's `of a person` / `of an Act or part of an Act` repeated
@ref Acts Interpretation Act 1901 s 34C(1) "periodic report" (src:757-760)
`section 34C(1) defines periodic report` MEANS
    `A meaning stated by the Act` OF `states a meaning`, JUST "a regular report relating to", (LIST "the activities, operations, business or affairs of a person", "the activities of a person", "the operations of a person", "the business of a person", "the affairs of a person", "activities", "operations", "business", "affairs", "the administration, operation or working of an Act or part of an Act", "the administration of an Act or part of an Act", "the operation of an Act or part of an Act", "the working of an Act or part of an Act", "administration", "operation", "working"), EMPTY, JUST "during a particular period that ends on or after 30 June 1983", NOTHING

