GIVEN term IS A `Term defined in the section that uses it`
GIVETH A `A meaning stated by the Act`
`the meaning the section gives` term MEANS
    CONSIDER term
    WHEN `the term adopted in section 2F(7)` THEN `section 2F(7) defines adopted`
    WHEN `the term coastal sea in section 15B(4)` THEN `section 15B(4) defines coastal sea`
    WHEN `the term authority in section 19B(7)` THEN `section 19B(7) defines authority`
    WHEN `the term authority in section 19C(6)` THEN `section 19C(6) defines authority`
    WHEN `the term authority in section 19D(5)` THEN `section 19D(5) defines authority`
    WHEN `the term office in section 21(2)` THEN `section 21(2) defines office`
    WHEN `the term officer in section 21(2)` THEN `section 21(2) defines officer`
    WHEN `the term office in section 25B(3)` THEN `section 25B(3) defines office`
    WHEN `the term office in section 33A(4)` THEN `section 33A(4) defines office`
    WHEN `the term paper in section 34B(2)` THEN `section 34B(2) defines paper`
    WHEN `the term periodic report in section 34C(1)` THEN `section 34C(1) defines periodic report`
    WHEN `the term person in section 34C(1)` THEN `section 34C(1) defines person`
    WHEN `the term holiday in section 36(3)` THEN `section 36(3) defines holiday`
    WHEN `the term new ASIC legislation in section 40A(6)` THEN `section 40A(6) defines new ASIC legislation`
    WHEN `the term new corporations legislation in section 40A(6)` THEN `section 40A(6) defines new corporations legislation`
    WHEN `the term old ASIC legislation in section 40A(6)` THEN `section 40A(6) defines old ASIC legislation`
    WHEN `the term old corporations legislation in section 40A(6)` THEN `section 40A(6) defines old corporations legislation`
    WHEN `the term relevant earlier law in section 40A(6)` THEN `section 40A(6) defines relevant earlier law`

§§ `Reading a table entry`

-- The Act's own words are in the entries above; these rules only read them back.
-- Section 2B's entries.
GIVEN term IS A `Defined term of section 2B`
GIVETH A `How the Act states a meaning`
`how section 2B states the meaning of` term MEANS (`the meaning section 2B gives` term)'s `how stated`

GIVEN term IS A `Defined term of section 2B`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the wording section 2B gives for` term MEANS (`the meaning section 2B gives` term)'s `what it means`

GIVEN term IS A `Defined term of section 2B`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`where section 2B points` term MEANS (`the meaning section 2B gives` term)'s `what it points at`

GIVEN term IS A `Defined term of section 2B`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the condition section 2B puts on` term MEANS (`the meaning section 2B gives` term)'s `only when`

GIVEN member IS A STRING, term IS A `Defined term of section 2B`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 2B names` member `as covered by` term MEANS elem member ((`the meaning section 2B gives` term)'s `members it names`)

GIVEN member IS A STRING, term IS A `Defined term of section 2B`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`section 2B leaves out` member `from` term MEANS elem member ((`the meaning section 2B gives` term)'s `members it leaves out`)

-- The entries defined inside the section that uses them.
GIVEN term IS A `Term defined in the section that uses it`
GIVETH A `How the Act states a meaning`
`how the section states the meaning of` term MEANS (`the meaning the section gives` term)'s `how stated`

GIVEN term IS A `Term defined in the section that uses it`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the wording the section gives for` term MEANS (`the meaning the section gives` term)'s `what it means`

GIVEN term IS A `Term defined in the section that uses it`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`where the section points` term MEANS (`the meaning the section gives` term)'s `what it points at`

GIVEN term IS A `Term defined in the section that uses it`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the condition the section puts on` term MEANS (`the meaning the section gives` term)'s `only when`

GIVEN member IS A STRING, term IS A `Term defined in the section that uses it`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the section names` member `as covered by` term MEANS elem member ((`the meaning the section gives` term)'s `members it names`)
